---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Data & Account Deletion | OffMesh"
  description="Google Play compliant Data Deletion policy and step-by-step cryptographic wipe instructions for OffMesh."
  canonical="https://offmesh.pages.dev/delete-data"
>
  <div class="compliance-page">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="compliance-header">
        <div class="badge">Google Play User Data Requirement</div>
        <h1 class="display-title">Data & Account Deletion</h1>
        <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: September 24, 2026 | Compliant with Play Store Data Safety</p>
      </div>

      <div class="compliance-body">
        <div class="highlight-callout">
          <h3>Self-Sovereign Identity Architecture</h3>
          <p>
            OffMesh does <strong>not</strong> require user registration, email addresses, phone numbers, or central cloud accounts. 
            Your identity is represented entirely by a local <strong>Ed25519 cryptographic keypair</strong> generated directly on your mobile device.
          </p>
        </div>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>1. How to Wipe All Data From Your Device</h2>
          <p>You can instantly and irreversibly erase all local data directly from within the OffMesh mobile application:</p>

          <div class="steps-list">
            <div class="step-item">
              <div class="step-num">1</div>
              <div class="step-text">
                <strong>Open OffMesh Settings</strong>
                <p>Launch the OffMesh application and tap the <strong>Settings</strong> icon (gear icon) in the bottom navigation bar.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-item">
              <div class="step-num">2</div>
              <div class="step-text">
                <strong>Select "Data & Privacy"</strong>
                <p>Navigate to the <em>Data & Privacy</em> section and select <strong>Wipe All Keys & Database</strong>.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-item">
              <div class="step-num">3</div>
              <div class="step-text">
                <strong>Confirm Cryptographic Shredding</strong>
                <p>Type <code>DELETE</code> or confirm the biometric prompt. The application immediately overwrites and deletes the local SQLite/Isar database, purges the private Ed25519 signing key and X25519 ratchet states from the hardware Keystore, and returns the app to a fresh, uninitialized state.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>2. What Data is Shredded Upon Local Wipe?</h2>
          <div class="compliance-card">
            <div class="card-row">
              <span class="card-label">Private Cryptographic Keys (Ed25519 / X25519)</span>
              <span class="card-status status-erased">Instantly Purged</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-row">
              <span class="card-label">Local Encrypted Message Database</span>
              <span class="card-status status-erased">Shredded from Disk</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-row">
              <span class="card-label">Peer Identity Cache & Fingerprints</span>
              <span class="card-status status-erased">Permanently Cleared</span>
            </div>
            <div class="card-row">
              <span class="card-label">Queued Hop Relay Blobs</span>
              <span class="card-status status-erased">Immediately Dropped</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>3. Transient Gateway Cache Expiration Policy</h2>
          <p>
            If your device ever synchronized with an optional OffMesh sync gateway while internet access was present, please note:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>The gateway stores only anonymous, encrypted ciphertext envelopes. It holds no plaintext, usernames, or phone numbers.</li>
            <li>All envelopes are bound to a strict <strong>7-Day Time-To-Live (TTL)</strong>. Once 7 days elapse from the upload timestamp, the Redis/Postgres storage automatically drops and purges the blob permanently.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="policy-section">
          <h2>4. Manual Gateway Purge Request</h2>
          <p>
            If you wish to request the immediate eviction of any uncollected encrypted envelopes associated with your public key hash prior to the 7-day TTL expiration:
          </p>
          <div class="contact-box">
            <p>Send a cryptographic signature or request with your public identity fingerprint to:</p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:data-deletion@offmesh.org" class="text-link">data-deletion@offmesh.org</a></p>
            <p>Subject: <em>OffMesh Gateway Cache Eviction Request</em></p>
            <p style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--color-text-tertiary);">Requests are processed automatically by key fingerprint hash eviction within 24 hours.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .compliance-page {
    padding: var(--space-12) 0 var(--space-20);
  }

  .compliance-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .last-updated {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
  }

  .highlight-callout {
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
  }

  .highlight-callout h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .highlight-callout p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .compliance-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .policy-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .policy-section p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .policy-section ul {
    margin: var(--space-3) 0 var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .policy-section li {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .steps-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
  }

  .step-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
  }

  .step-num {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-action-primary);
    color: var(--color-action-on-primary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .step-text strong {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .step-text p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .compliance-card {
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
  }

  .card-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: var(--space-3) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .card-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .card-label {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  .card-status {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .status-erased { background: #FEE4E2; color: var(--color-status-error); }

  .text-link {
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .contact-box {
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }
</style>
